'''Frosty Kai''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[Xmas Gals (Gacha Event)|Xmas Gals]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 4.5 Update|Version 4.5]] and is an [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]]/[[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Kai]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]] increases her health, damage and speed. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]].

